  m_Name: 'Label - CRANE LIFT PLAN CHECK


    FIELD DATA

    Load = 6,200 lb; rigging
    = 800 lb. Chart capacity: 6,500 lb at

    60 ft radius, 8,200 lb at 50 ft radius.


    CHECK

    Gross
    load = 7,000 lb. At 60 ft: 7,000/6,500 = 108%. At 50 ft:

    7,000/8,200 = 85%.


    DECISION

    Which
    lift decision is supported by the load chart?


    OSHA 1926.1417(o): do not
    exceed rated capacity; verify load

    weight and operating configuration.'
