  m_Text: 'CON-01  DIAGNOSE SITE RISK


    OBJECTIVE

    Collect and classify field
    evidence for fall, struck-by,

    excavation, access, and temporary-works hazards.


    ASSESSMENT
    EVIDENCE

    At least three relevant observations, with distractors

    distinguished.


    STANDARD

    ABET
    SO1; OSHA 29 CFR 1926


    SELECT BOARD FOR NEXT OBJECTIVE'
