  m_Layer: 0
  m_Name: 'Label - TRENCH PROTECTIVE SYSTEM


    FIELD DATA

    Excavation = 6.5
    ft deep in Type C soil. Spoil is 1 ft from the

    edge. Nearest ladder is 34
    ft away. No protective system is

    installed.


    CHECK

    Depth > 5 ft
    requires protection unless stable rock. Spoil needs

    >=2 ft setback. Lateral
    travel to egress must be <=25 ft for

    trenches >=4 ft deep.


    DECISION

    What
    must happen before a worker enters?


    OSHA 1926.651(c)(2), (j)(2) and 1926.652(a).'
