  - component: {fileID: 2063142936}
  - component: {fileID: 2063142935}
  m_Layer: 0
  m_Name: 'Label - FORMWORK / SHORING CHECK


    FIELD DATA

    Slab: 14 ft x 10
    ft x 8 in; concrete = 150 pcf. Crew/equipment =

    3,500 lb. Forms = 1,500
    lb. Four shore frames are rated 4,000 lb

    each.


    CHECK

    Concrete
    14 x 10 x 0.667 x 150 = 14,000 lb. Total demand =

    19,000 lb. Capacity =
    16,000 lb. D/C = 1.19 > 1.00.


    DECISION

    Can the documented shore configuration
    support the anticipated

    construction load?


    OSHA 1926.703(a): formwork
    must support reasonably anticipated

    vertical and lateral loads; drawings
    and revisions must be

    available onsite.'
  m_TagString: Untagged
  m_Icon: {fileID: 0}
  m_NavMeshLayer: 0
  m_StaticEditorFlags: 0
  m_IsActive: 1
